  "title": "MCP does way more than you think (Repeat)",
  "description": "You've connected an MCP server or two. But MCP in GitHub Copilot goes a lot further than tool lookups — and it works across the editor, CLI, and cloud. This session demos the range: connecting Copilot to databases, APIs, and internal systems wherever you work, plus a first look at MCP Apps, where tool calls return real UI like dashboards and forms right in chat. All live, all demos, no slides.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
